  "meta": {
    "instanceId": "REPLACE_ON_IMPORT",
    "templateNote": "Calls dueDatasets()+syncDataset() via POST /api/trigger/sync. Core ingestion tick. maxDuration=300s server-side, so timeoutMs is 300000 here (overriding the sub-workflow's default) rather than the usual 60000. After import, open the Execute Workflow node and re-select '_Trigger Caller' from its workflow dropdown (same caveat as the Error Workflow field \u2014 n8n assigns the real id at import time, the JSON placeholder can't resolve it automatically)."
